  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Döngüde `kind == \"A\"` ise dur; CNAME ise `name = value` ile devam et.",
      "en": "In the loop, stop if `kind == \"A\"`; on a CNAME continue with `name = value`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "8 CNAME izleyip dokuzuncu adda A bulmak geçerlidir: döngü 9 kez döner, sonra `\"LOOP\"`.",
      "en": "Following 8 CNAMEs and finding an A on the ninth name is valid: the loop runs 9 times, then `\"LOOP\"`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef resolve(records, name):\n    for _ in range(9):\n        record = records.get(name)\n        if record is None:\n            return \"NXDOMAIN\"\n        kind, value = record\n        if kind == \"A\":\n            return value\n        name = value\n    return \"LOOP\"\n\nRECORDS = {\n    \"example.com\": [\"A\", \"203.0.113.10\"],\n    \"www.example.com\": [\"CNAME\", \"example.com\"],\n    \"a.example\": [\"CNAME\", \"b.example\"],\n    \"b.example\": [\"CNAME\", \"a.example\"],\n}\nfor name in [\"www.example.com\", \"mail.example.com\", \"a.example\"]:\n    print(name, resolve(RECORDS, name))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef resolve(records, name):\n    for _ in range(9):\n        record = records.get(name)\n        if record is None:\n            return \"NXDOMAIN\"\n        kind, value = record\n        if kind == \"A\":\n            return value\n        name = value\n    return \"LOOP\"\n\nRECORDS = {\n    \"example.com\": [\"A\", \"203.0.113.10\"],\n    \"www.example.com\": [\"CNAME\", \"example.com\"],\n    \"a.example\": [\"CNAME\", \"b.example\"],\n    \"b.example\": [\"CNAME\", \"a.example\"],\n}\nfor name in [\"www.example.com\", \"mail.example.com\", \"a.example\"]:\n    print(name, resolve(RECORDS, name))\n```"
    }
  ],
